  "notes": {
    "raw": "Phase change: 933.61 K, melting point of Al; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.580$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{\\circ} = 7.598 + 1.956 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.175 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ \n$$\n\\mathrm{H} ^ {0} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {0} = 7. 5 9 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 9 7 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 1 7 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2. 4 1 1\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-933.61 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 41.071 - 1.166 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.909 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 0.750 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$$\n\\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 4 1. 0 7 1 + 1. 1 6 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 9 0 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 3 7 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2 9. 4 0 7 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T}\n$$\n933.61-2000 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 39.803 - 4.164 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} + 0.818 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} - 16.650 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$$\n\\Delta \\mathrm{Gr} ^ {\\circ} = 3 9. 8 0 3 + 4. 1 6 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} - 0. 8 1 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 8. 3 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 4 6. 9 3 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T}\n$$\nSource: Data from Gurvich (50). ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "Phase change: 933.61 K, melting point of Al; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.580$ kcal/mol.",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{\\circ} = 7.598 + 1.956 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.175 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$",
      "$$",
      "\\mathrm{H} ^ {0} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {0} = 7. 5 9 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 9 7 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 1 7 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2. 4 1 1",
      "$$",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
      "298.15-933.61 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 41.071 - 1.166 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.909 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 0.750 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$$",
      "\\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 4 1. 0 7 1 + 1. 1 6 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 9 0 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 3 7 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2 9. 4 0 7 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T}",
      "$$",
      "933.61-2000 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 39.803 - 4.164 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} + 0.818 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} - 16.650 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$$",
      "\\Delta \\mathrm{Gr} ^ {\\circ} = 3 9. 8 0 3 + 4. 1 6 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} - 0. 8 1 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 8. 3 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 4 6. 9 3 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T}",
      "$$",
      "Source: Data from Gurvich (50)."
